Split the cross-section into two rectangles.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=0.5]
\draw (0,0)--(8,0)--(8,3)--(3,3)--(3,8)--(0,8)--cycle;
\draw[dashed] (3,0)--(3,3);
\node at (5.5,1.5) {$24\text{ cm}^{2}$};
\node at (1.5,4.5) {$15\text{ cm}^{2}$};
\draw (0,0)--(8,0) node[midway,below] {$8\text{ cm}$};
\draw (8,0)--(8,3) node[midway,right] {$3\text{ cm}$};
\draw (0,8)--(0,0) node[midway,left] {$8\text{ cm}$};
\draw (3,8)--(0,8) node[midway,above] {$3\text{ cm}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
$A = (8 \times 3) + (3 \times 5)$
$= 24 + 15$
$= 39\text{ cm}^{2}$
$V = Ah$
$= 39 \times 6$
$= 234\text{ cm}^{3}$

